{"seq":1,"slug":"compose-compiler-internals","title":"Compose 编译器原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/compose-compiler-internals","wordCount":692,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"compose-编译器原理\">Compose 编译器原理</h1><p>Compose 表面上是一个 UI 框架，但其真正的技术核心是一个 <strong>Kotlin 编译器插件</strong>——它在编译期对 <code>@Composable</code> 函数进行 IR（Intermediate Representation）变换，注入 Group 管理、参数比较、跳过逻辑和重启点。没有这个编译器，Composable 函数就只是普通 Kotlin 函数，无法实现增量重组。理解编译器的变换规则，能让你准确预判运行时行为并做出正确的性能优化决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 编译器插件工作在 Kotlin 编译的 IR 阶段——在语法解析和类型检查之后、生成字节码之前。它识别所有 <code>@Composable</code> 注解的函数，对其函数签名和函数体进行系统化改写。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Kotlin 源码 (.kt)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Frontend: 语法/类型检查&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Kotlin IR&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Compose Compiler Plugin&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;变换后的 IR&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Backend: 生成 JVM bytecode / JS / Native&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph Compose 编译器变换&#10;        D --&gt; G[&quot;注入 Composer 参数&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; H[&quot;插入 Group 标记&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; I[&quot;生成比较+跳过逻辑&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; J[&quot;Lambda remember 化&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; K[&quot;稳定性推断&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[\"Kotlin 源码 (.kt)\"] --&gt; B[\"Frontend: 语法/类型检查\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Kotlin IR\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Compose Compiler Plugin\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"变换后的 IR\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Backend: 生成 JVM bytecode / JS / Native\"]\n\n    subgraph Compose 编译器变换\n        D --&gt; G[\"注入 Composer 参数\"]\n        D --&gt; H[\"插入 Group 标记\"]\n        D --&gt; I[\"生成比较+跳过逻辑\"]\n        D --&gt; J[\"Lambda remember 化\"]\n        D --&gt; K[\"稳定性推断\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变换类型</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>对开发者的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Composer 参数注入</td>\n<td>传递运行时上下文</td>\n<td><code>@Composable</code> 函数不能从非 Composable 调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Group 标记插入</td>\n<td>Slot Table 中的定位锚点</td>\n<td>控制流中的 Composable 需要 <code>key</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Changed 参数生成</td>\n<td>传递参数是否变化的位图</td>\n<td>减少运行时比较开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳过逻辑注入</td>\n<td>参数未变时跳过函数体</td>\n<td>Strong Skipping 的生成规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lambda memoization</td>\n<td>非捕获 lambda 自动 remember</td>\n<td>减少 lambda 导致的重组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Default 参数处理</td>\n<td>默认值只在需要时计算</td>\n<td>默认参数不参与比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"函数签名变换\">函数签名变换</h2><p>编译器对每个 <code>@Composable</code> 函数添加隐藏参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 源码&#10;@Composable&#10;fun Greeting(name: String, age: Int) {&#10;    Text(&quot;Hello $name, age $age&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 编译器变换后（伪代码）&#10;fun Greeting(&#10;    name: String,&#10;    age: Int,&#10;    $composer: Composer,    // 运行时上下文&#10;    $changed: Int           // 参数变化位图&#10;) {&#10;    $composer.startRestartGroup(hashKey)&#10;&#10;    // 参数是否&quot;确定未变&quot;的检查&#10;    val $dirty = $changed&#10;    if ($changed and 0b0110 == 0) {  // name 的变化状态未知&#10;        $dirty = $dirty or if ($composer.changed(name)) 0b0100 else 0b0010&#10;    }&#10;    if ($changed and 0b0110_0000 == 0) {  // age 的变化状态未知&#10;        $dirty = $dirty or if ($composer.changed(age)) 0b0100_0000 else 0b0010_0000&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 跳过判断&#10;    if ($dirty and 0b0101_0101 xor 0b0010_0010 != 0 || !$composer.skipping) {&#10;        // 执行函数体&#10;        Text(&quot;Hello $name, age $age&quot;, $composer, ...)&#10;    } else {&#10;        // 跳过&#10;        $composer.skipToGroupEnd()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    $composer.endRestartGroup()?.updateScope { nc, _ -&gt;&#10;        Greeting(name, age, nc, $changed or 0b0001)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 源码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Greeting(name: String, age: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Text(\"Hello $name, age $age\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译器变换后（伪代码）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Greeting(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    age: Int,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $composer: Composer,    // 运行时上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $changed: Int           // 参数变化位图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $composer.startRestartGroup(hashKey)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 参数是否\"确定未变\"的检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val $dirty = $changed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ($changed and 0b0110 == 0) {  // name 的变化状态未知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $dirty = $dirty or if ($composer.changed(name)) 0b0100 else 0b0010</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ($changed and 0b0110_0000 == 0) {  // age 的变化状态未知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $dirty = $dirty or if ($composer.changed(age)) 0b0100_0000 else 0b0010_0000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 跳过判断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ($dirty and 0b0101_0101 xor 0b0010_0010 != 0 || !$composer.skipping) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 执行函数体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(\"Hello $name, age $age\", $composer, ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        $composer.skipToGroupEnd()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $composer.endRestartGroup()?.updateScope { nc, _ -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Greeting(name, age, nc, $changed or 0b0001)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"changed-位图编码\">$changed 位图编码</h2><p>每个参数占用 <code>$changed</code> 中的若干位，编码三种状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 每个参数用 3 bit 编码状态：&#10;// 0b000 = UNCERTAIN（未知，需要运行时比较）&#10;// 0b010 = SAME（调用方已确定未变化）&#10;// 0b100 = DIFFERENT（调用方已确定变化了）&#10;// 0b001 = STATIC（参数是编译期常量，永远 SAME）&#10;&#10;// 示例：Greeting(name = &quot;World&quot;, age = localAge)&#10;// name = &quot;World&quot; → STATIC，编译器传 0b001&#10;// age = localAge → 取决于上层是否知道 localAge 变没变&#10;&#10;// 当参数超过 ~10 个时，使用多个 $changed 参数&#10;// $changed1, $changed2, ... 各承载约 10 个参数的状态\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 每个参数用 3 bit 编码状态：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 0b000 = UNCERTAIN（未知，需要运行时比较）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 0b010 = SAME（调用方已确定未变化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 0b100 = DIFFERENT（调用方已确定变化了）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 0b001 = STATIC（参数是编译期常量，永远 SAME）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 示例：Greeting(name = \"World\", age = localAge)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// name = \"World\" → STATIC，编译器传 0b001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// age = localAge → 取决于上层是否知道 localAge 变没变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当参数超过 ~10 个时，使用多个 $changed 参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// $changed1, $changed2, ... 各承载约 10 个参数的状态</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"restartable-与-skippable\">Restartable 与 Skippable</h2><p>编译器为每个 Composable 标记两个属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Restartable：函数可以被单独重新执行（大多数 Composable）&#10;// Non-restartable：inline composable、返回值的 composable&#10;&#10;// Skippable：函数在参数未变时可以跳过&#10;// Non-skippable：有 Unstable 参数（Legacy 模式）或 inline&#10;&#10;// 编译器报告中的标记：&#10;// restartable skippable fun UserCard(user: StableUser, onClick: () -&gt; Unit)&#10;// restartable fun RawDataDisplay(data: UnstableData)  ← 非 skippable&#10;&#10;// Strong Skipping 模式下，第二个也变为 skippable&#10;// （对 UnstableData 使用 === 比较）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Restartable：函数可以被单独重新执行（大多数 Composable）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Non-restartable：inline composable、返回值的 composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Skippable：函数在参数未变时可以跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Non-skippable：有 Unstable 参数（Legacy 模式）或 inline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译器报告中的标记：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// restartable skippable fun UserCard(user: StableUser, onClick: () -> Unit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// restartable fun RawDataDisplay(data: UnstableData)  ← 非 skippable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Strong Skipping 模式下，第二个也变为 skippable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// （对 UnstableData 使用 === 比较）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lambda-memoization\">Lambda Memoization</h2><p>Strong Skipping 模式下，编译器对 Composable 内的 lambda 表达式自动 remember 化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 源码&#10;@Composable&#10;fun Parent() {&#10;    val viewModel = viewModel&lt;MyViewModel&gt;()&#10;    Child(onClick = { viewModel.doAction() })&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 编译器变换后（概念）&#10;@Composable&#10;fun Parent($composer: Composer, $changed: Int) {&#10;    val viewModel = viewModel&lt;MyViewModel&gt;()&#10;&#10;    // 编译器自动 remember 这个 lambda&#10;    // 因为它捕获的 viewModel 在重组间是同一实例&#10;    val remembered$onClick = $composer.cache(&#10;        invalid = $composer.changed(viewModel)&#10;    ) { { viewModel.doAction() } }&#10;&#10;    Child(onClick = remembered$onClick, $composer, ...)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 条件：&#10;// - lambda 捕获的所有值都是 Stable 或在重组间不变&#10;// - Strong Skipping 启用时放宽为：捕获值实例不变即可 remember\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 源码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Parent() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val viewModel = viewModel&#x3C;MyViewModel>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Child(onClick = { viewModel.doAction() })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译器变换后（概念）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Parent($composer: Composer, $changed: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val viewModel = viewModel&#x3C;MyViewModel>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 编译器自动 remember 这个 lambda</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 因为它捕获的 viewModel 在重组间是同一实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val remembered$onClick = $composer.cache(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        invalid = $composer.changed(viewModel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { { viewModel.doAction() } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Child(onClick = remembered$onClick, $composer, ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 条件：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - lambda 捕获的所有值都是 Stable 或在重组间不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - Strong Skipping 启用时放宽为：捕获值实例不变即可 remember</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"composer-的关键方法\">Composer 的关键方法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Composer 是编译器注入的运行时上下文，核心方法：&#10;interface Composer {&#10;    fun startRestartGroup(key: Int): Composer  // 开始可重启 Group&#10;    fun endRestartGroup(): ScopeUpdateScope?   // 结束 Group，返回更新作用域&#10;&#10;    fun startReplaceGroup(key: Int)  // 可替换 Group（if/when 分支）&#10;    fun endReplaceGroup()&#10;&#10;    fun startMovableGroup(key: Any?)  // 可移动 Group（key {} 包裹）&#10;    fun endMovableGroup()&#10;&#10;    fun changed(value: Any?): Boolean  // 比较当前值与 Slot 中旧值&#10;    fun updateRememberedValue(value: Any?)  // 更新 remember 的值&#10;&#10;    fun skipToGroupEnd()  // 跳过当前 Group 剩余部分&#10;    val skipping: Boolean  // 当前是否处于跳过状态&#10;&#10;    fun cache(invalid: Boolean, block: () -&gt; Any?): Any?  // lambda remember&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Composer 是编译器注入的运行时上下文，核心方法：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Composer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun startRestartGroup(key: Int): Composer  // 开始可重启 Group</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun endRestartGroup(): ScopeUpdateScope?   // 结束 Group，返回更新作用域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun startReplaceGroup(key: Int)  // 可替换 Group（if/when 分支）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun endReplaceGroup()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun startMovableGroup(key: Any?)  // 可移动 Group（key {} 包裹）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun endMovableGroup()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun changed(value: Any?): Boolean  // 比较当前值与 Slot 中旧值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun updateRememberedValue(value: Any?)  // 更新 remember 的值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun skipToGroupEnd()  // 跳过当前 Group 剩余部分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val skipping: Boolean  // 当前是否处于跳过状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun cache(invalid: Boolean, block: () -> Any?): Any?  // lambda remember</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-kotlin-版本的绑定\">与 Kotlin 版本的绑定</h2><p>从 Kotlin 2.0 起，Compose 编译器插件被合并进 Kotlin 编译器仓库（<code>org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose</code>），版本与 Kotlin 版本锁定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts (Kotlin 2.0+)&#10;plugins {&#10;    kotlin(&quot;jvm&quot;) version &quot;2.1.20&quot;&#10;    kotlin(&quot;plugin.compose&quot;) version &quot;2.1.20&quot;  // 版本与 kotlin 一致&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 不再需要单独指定 compose compiler 版本&#10;// 旧写法（已废弃）：&#10;// composeOptions { kotlinCompilerExtensionVersion = &quot;1.5.x&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts (Kotlin 2.0+)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"jvm\") version \"2.1.20\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"plugin.compose\") version \"2.1.20\"  // 版本与 kotlin 一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不再需要单独指定 compose compiler 版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 旧写法（已废弃）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// composeOptions { kotlinCompilerExtensionVersion = \"1.5.x\" }</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Kotlin 版本</th>\n<th>Compose Compiler</th>\n<th>关键变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2.0.0</td>\n<td>合并进 Kotlin</td>\n<td>不再需要独立版本号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.0.20</td>\n<td>同步更新</td>\n<td>iOS 性能优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.1.0</td>\n<td>K2 完全适配</td>\n<td>Compose Multiplatform 1.8 依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.1.20</td>\n<td>Strong Skipping 默认</td>\n<td>Lambda memoization 增强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Compose 编译器在 Kotlin IR 阶段变换 <code>@Composable</code> 函数：注入 Composer、Group 标记、比较+跳过逻辑</li>\n<li><code>$changed</code> 位图将参数变化信息从调用方传播到被调用方，减少运行时比较</li>\n<li>Restartable = 可被单独重组；Skippable = 参数未变时可跳过执行</li>\n<li>Lambda memoization 在 Strong Skipping 下自动 remember 化捕获稳定值的 lambda</li>\n<li>从 Kotlin 2.0 起编译器插件版本与 Kotlin 版本锁定，无需单独管理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/strong-skipping-and-stability\">Strong Skipping 与稳定性</a>——编译器生成的跳过逻辑如何与稳定性推断配合</li>\n<li><a href=\"performance-optimization\">性能优化实战</a>——利用编译器报告诊断跳过失败的实际案例</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/compiler-plugins\">Kotlin 进阶 · 编译器插件</a>——Kotlin 编译器插件的通用架构与开发方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Compose 编译器原理","id":"compose-编译器原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"函数签名变换","id":"函数签名变换"},{"level":2,"text":"$changed 位图编码","id":"changed-位图编码"},{"level":2,"text":"Restartable 与 Skippable","id":"restartable-与-skippable"},{"level":2,"text":"Lambda Memoization","id":"lambda-memoization"},{"level":2,"text":"Composer 的关键方法","id":"composer-的关键方法"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Kotlin 版本的绑定","id":"与-kotlin-版本的绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"状态提升模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/architecture/state-hoisting-patterns"},"next":{"title":"性能优化实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/performance-optimization"}}